BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tree Time Preschool Walks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260216T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260216T110000
UID:6839b02482a3881357d893f8-0@travelportland.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://res.cloudinary.com/dragonspell/w_480,h_4
 80,c_fill,g_auto,dpr_auto,fl_progressive:steep/event-images/cdn.digitaloce
 anspaces.com/public/scrapers/travelportlandEvent-9454-0_jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Come for a story and guided walk on the trails at Hoyt Arboret
 um. Use your senses to explore the natural surroundings and maybe even get
  your hands dirty. Staff and trained Arboretum volunteers will introduce y
