BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Good Grief\, Dru Rutledge!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260410T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260410T230000
UID:69b9a73af1b66ba3065e55ff-0@travelportland.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://res.cloudinary.com/dragonspell/w_480,h_4
 80,c_fill,g_auto,dpr_auto,fl_progressive:steep/event-images/s3.cruncho.co/
 eventmanager-assets/public/eu-west-1:ced5e211-a7fb-cdd8-a983-432cd410a93b/
 w-1080h-1080-4e565c-grief_jpg.png
DESCRIPTION:For almost 34 years\, Dru woke up wondering: "Is today the day
  my mom dies?" Their mom\, M'Liz Crawford\, was diagnosed with M.S. when t
 hey were 9. Their family prepared for everything — except her actual dea
 th and what the hell they'd do after.
LOCATION:Fuse Theatre Ensemble - The Back Door Theater\, 4319 SE Hawthorne
  Blvd\, Portland\, OR 97215
